{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/74817d87a74ae0edbd3ae5869117c52e.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Shop Simulator</strong> is a fantasy shop simulation game where you sell magical eggs, hatch and collect monsters, host monster cage events, and grow your own monster shop business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/ce5921f451f7dbb49c8b5d676bbd46ac.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/ce5921f451f7dbb49c8b5d676bbd46ac.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/ce5921f451f7dbb49c8b5d676bbd46ac.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR SHOP</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own monster shop. Organize shelves, magical eggs, and monster displays to make the customer shopping experience smooth and easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/fbf8fdd3a7989d9e3a7927ef58569bb2.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/fbf8fdd3a7989d9e3a7927ef58569bb2.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/fbf8fdd3a7989d9e3a7927ef58569bb2.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGG CRACK</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack magical eggs to collect monsters. Find rare creatures, sell them for a big profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/da2671a7ea6854dea82aaaa252683dac.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/da2671a7ea6854dea82aaaa252683dac.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/da2671a7ea6854dea82aaaa252683dac.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOST GAME</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your monster cage event rules and entry fee, then invite customers to join monster battles in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/0ce39a2377522d2241277b4bb298e5aa.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/0ce39a2377522d2241277b4bb298e5aa.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/0ce39a2377522d2241277b4bb298e5aa.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONSTER COLLECTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your collection with rare and valuable monsters found in surprise eggs. Keep them to complete your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/7fc16d65e8b4458f3c167c0ab584678a.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/7fc16d65e8b4458f3c167c0ab584678a.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/7fc16d65e8b4458f3c167c0ab584678a.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPAND SHOP</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to grow your monster shop. Expand your space, unlock new eggs and monsters, and upgrade your store to attract more customers and boost your income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/892a1f5d6c985498ba8b3bada32067cf.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/892a1f5d6c985498ba8b3bada32067cf.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/892a1f5d6c985498ba8b3bada32067cf.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611450?t=1772898039","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/ac5c4a300f9378e573337df9e2c4f66b8763db5d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772898039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/3aad60693e2b6696387412cac22fc9df55811c88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772898039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/3aad60693e2b6696387412cac22fc9df55811c88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772898039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/74817d87a74ae0edbd3ae5869117c52e.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Shop Simulator</strong> is a fantasy shop simulation game where you sell magical eggs, hatch and collect monsters, host monster cage events, and grow your own monster shop business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/ce5921f451f7dbb49c8b5d676bbd46ac.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/ce5921f451f7dbb49c8b5d676bbd46ac.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/ce5921f451f7dbb49c8b5d676bbd46ac.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR SHOP</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own monster shop. Organize shelves, magical eggs, and monster displays to make the customer shopping experience smooth and easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/fbf8fdd3a7989d9e3a7927ef58569bb2.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/fbf8fdd3a7989d9e3a7927ef58569bb2.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/fbf8fdd3a7989d9e3a7927ef58569bb2.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGG CRACK</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack magical eggs to collect monsters. Find rare creatures, sell them for a big profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/da2671a7ea6854dea82aaaa252683dac.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/da2671a7ea6854dea82aaaa252683dac.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/da2671a7ea6854dea82aaaa252683dac.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOST GAME</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your monster cage event rules and entry fee, then invite customers to join monster battles in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/0ce39a2377522d2241277b4bb298e5aa.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/0ce39a2377522d2241277b4bb298e5aa.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/0ce39a2377522d2241277b4bb298e5aa.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONSTER COLLECTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your collection with rare and valuable monsters found in surprise eggs. Keep them to complete your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/7fc16d65e8b4458f3c167c0ab584678a.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/7fc16d65e8b4458f3c167c0ab584678a.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/7fc16d65e8b4458f3c167c0ab584678a.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPAND SHOP</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to grow your monster shop. Expand your space, unlock new eggs and monsters, and upgrade your store to attract more customers and boost your income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/892a1f5d6c985498ba8b3bada32067cf.poster.avif?t=1772898039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/892a1f5d6c985498ba8b3bada32067cf.webm?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/extras/892a1f5d6c985498ba8b3bada32067cf.mp4?t=1772898039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["For Fun Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611450/937d900955024359b85eb594cf8ca92b46f9ad64/header.jpg?t=1772898039","is_free":false,"linux_req